  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EBRD Ukraine Recovery and Reconstruction Guarantee</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A  public-private partnership composed of Ukrianian authoroties, insurance broker companies and EBRD has composed a scheme to reduce the insurance costs of ship traffic on the Danube and the Black Sea, carrying cargo (predominantly grains and other agricultural products). Norwegian funding co-finance the Ukrainian financing of a risk cover to be used as security to provide necessary insurances to foster incresed exports.</narrative>
  </description>
